OL,3,ASex abuse teacher arrested for missing 
OL,4,Asentencing                             
OL,6,FAfter being convicted earlier this year
OL,7,Fof seven counts of indecent assault,   
OL,8,Fthe 65-year-old was granted bail ahead 
OL,9,Fof Friday's scheduled sentencing       
OL,10,Fhearing.                               
